    "turn_idx": 2,
    "turn_text": "I think it's going great. I mean, we spent a lot of time in Iowa, we've done 21 trips there, 12 to New Hampshire, and I think my message, which is about bringing this terribly divided nation back together, solving real problems that are facing workers and families, particularly in light of how technology is changing the workforce, getting big things done to build a better future, and restoring a sense of almost moral aspiration to our political discourse.",
