    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "And we saw that from Lindsey Graham. But a broader question now, you know, you are trying to talk about healing the divide. Now, 10 years in this country, over the space of eight years, we saw the country like Barack Obama president and Donald Trump president. You couldn't imagine really two more different people to hold that office. So how do you speak to that divide?",
