        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Healing the divide requires addressing fundamental differences in values or ideologies.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Political leaders serve as symbolic representations of deeper societal divisions.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes the audience recognizes the contrast between Obama and Trump as relevant.",
